= Marx in trouble

The enabling act that allowed Marx to form his minority government is about to expire. No party has showed itself willing to extend it - most parties have even presented demands on overturning the legislation of the current administration. We'd have to hold new elections.

  
- @new_election_shit: It will be new elections
- @extend_for_some_reason: Actually we want to extend the enabling act


@new_election_shit
on-arrival: catholic_dnvp += 3; old_middle_dnvp += 3; rural_other += 2; next_election_time = 5; next_election_month = 5

We will have new elections in May.

@extend_for_some_reason
